      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It would be easier, yes—but not in the way you might hope. Stopping the fight doesn't bring peace; it just makes the silence heavier. You're not \"irreparable\"—you're exhausted, and there's a huge difference between being broken and being worn down. And even if you can't feel it right now, your existence still matters, and your story isn't over just because it's painful. You don't have to be okay today, but please don't let the tiredness convince you that you're beyond repair.",
